<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs weak/mostly lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs weak/mostly lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said early bids on barrows and gilts were weak to mostly lower, but the market was not fully established.</p>
